      "text": "resolves the turn against conversation history —\nthe reason this is not naive RAG:\n• pronoun / ellipsis resolution → standalone query\n   “and what about termination?” → “What are the\n   termination rights under the Acme MSA?”\n• HyDE-style expansion + 3 query variants\n• legal-synonym widening (assignment / transfer,\n   change of control / merger / successor)",
