      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790905921714,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "one query, two vector spaces, server-side fusion:\n• DENSE   bge-large-en-v1.5, 1024-d, cosine\n• SPARSE  BM25 / SPLADE — exact clause numbers,\n   party names, dollar figures, statute cites\n• Reciprocal Rank Fusion over both  →  top-k 40\n• payload filter: doc_ids + status=ready + section\n• run all 3 query variants, union + dedupe",
      "originalText": "one query, two vector spaces, server-side fusion:\n• DENSE   bge-large-en-v1.5, 1024-d, cosine\n• SPARSE  BM25 / SPLADE — exact clause numbers,\n   party names, dollar figures, statute cites\n• Reciprocal Rank Fusion over both  →  top-k 40\n• payload filter: doc_ids + status=ready + section\n• run all 3 query variants, union + dedupe",
