      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "bge-reranker-v2-m3 — scores (query, chunk) pairs\njointly instead of comparing two embeddings\n• 40 candidates  →  top 8\n• score floor 0.25; everything below is dropped\n• if nothing clears the floor → structured refusal,\n   not a low-quality answer  (FR-14)",
      "originalText": "bge-reranker-v2-m3 — scores (query, chunk) pairs\njointly instead of comparing two embeddings\n• 40 candidates  →  top 8\n• score floor 0.25; everything below is dropped\n• if nothing clears the floor → structured refusal,\n   not a low-quality answer  (FR-14)",
