      "text": "retrieve on small chunks, generate on large ones:\n• child chunk → its parent section window\n• a numbered clause is expanded whole, never\n   truncated mid-obligation\n• +/-1 sibling chunk for run-on provisions\n• dedupe overlaps, then fit a token budget",
      "originalText": "retrieve on small chunks, generate on large ones:\n• child chunk → its parent section window\n• a numbered clause is expanded whole, never\n   truncated mid-obligation\n• +/-1 sibling chunk for run-on provisions\n• dedupe overlaps, then fit a token budget",
