      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "untrusted input is fenced, never concatenated:\n   <document id=... page=... span=...>  ...text...  </document>\n• system instructions structurally separated from\n   retrieved content  (TS-4)\n• every block carries its span_id so the model can\n   only cite what it was actually given",
      "originalText": "untrusted input is fenced, never concatenated:\n   <document id=... page=... span=...>  ...text...  </document>\n• system instructions structurally separated from\n   retrieved content  (TS-4)\n• every block carries its span_id so the model can\n   only cite what it was actually given",
