      "text": "• cite-as-you-write: every claim ends with\n   [doc_id : page : span_id]\n• instructed to answer “not in your documents”\n   when the context does not support an answer\n• tokens streamed straight through to SSE\n• model + prompt version stamped  (NFR-12)",
