      "text": "how a 300-page agreement is summarised without\nsilently truncating it  (FR-17):\n• section summaries → group summaries → document\n• COVERAGE LEDGER: pages seen / skipped / failed,\n   returned with the summary\n• conflicting extractions surfaced, not averaged",
