      "text": "the rule that keeps this out of Mata v. Avianca:\n• emitted cites  within  allowlist from step (3)\n• any case cite, statute cite or docket number\n   not present in the sources is STRIPPED — including\n   ones the model “knows” to be real  (FR-22)\n• Bluebook formatting derived from source text only",
