      "text": "file-backed, zero-ops for v1; Postgres swap at M6 with no schema change\n\nusers · conversations · messages\nmessage_citations (span refs)\ndocuments · document_pages\nchunk_meta (chunk_id <-> qdrant point)\nfeedback · audit_log\nusage_transactions ($ + tokens)\ningestion_jobs · eval_runs\nprompt_versions · index_versions",
