      "updated": 1790905921719,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• original uploaded file (AES-256 at rest)\n• rendered page images for the citation\n   viewer\n• SHA-256 content hash → upload dedupe\n• signed, short-lived read URLs only\n• no document content ever leaves for\n   telemetry, analytics or error tracking\n   (DR-5)\n• TLS in transit throughout (NFR-9)",
      "originalText": "• original uploaded file (AES-256 at rest)\n• rendered page images for the citation\n   viewer\n• SHA-256 content hash → upload dedupe\n• signed, short-lived read URLs only\n• no document content ever leaves for\n   telemetry, analytics or error tracking\n   (DR-5)\n• TLS in transit throughout (NFR-9)",
