      "text": "the thing that makes a citation clickable:\n\n• full extracted text per page\n• char-offset map  text <-> page <-> bbox\n• reading order + column assignment\n• section / clause tree per document\n• per-page OCR confidence\n• parse engine + version (reproducibility)",
