      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790905921719,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• type = one of PDF, DOCX, TXT\n• reject > 50 MB or\n   > 500 pages, naming\n   the limit and the\n   actual value (FR-2)\n• malware scan\n• SHA-256 dedupe\n• write encrypted blob\n• row → documents",
      "originalText": "• type = one of PDF, DOCX, TXT\n• reject > 50 MB or\n   > 500 pages, naming\n   the limit and the\n   actual value (FR-2)\n• malware scan\n• SHA-256 dedupe\n• write encrypted blob\n• row → documents",
