      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790905921719,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Celery / RQ + Redis\n\n• one job per file —\n   a single failure must\n   not fail the batch\n• status transitions:\n   queued → parsing →\n   indexing → ready\n   | failed (FR-3)\n• retry w/ backoff\n• progress polled by\n   /documents/{id}/status",
      "originalText": "Celery / RQ + Redis\n\n• one job per file —\n   a single failure must\n   not fail the batch\n• status transitions:\n   queued → parsing →\n   indexing → ready\n   | failed (FR-3)\n• retry w/ backoff\n• progress polled by\n   /documents/{id}/status",
      "fontSize": 11.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
