      "text": "• format router\n• TEXT-LAYER PROBE:\n   chars/page heuristic →\n   machine-readable vs\n   scanned\n• LAYOUT PARSER (Docling\n   / unstructured hi_res):\n   reading order, 2-column\n   detection, tables,\n   headers/footers,\n   footnotes, exhibit\n   stamps over body text\n• OCR (Tesseract /\n   PaddleOCR) on scanned\n   pages, per-page conf",
      "originalText": "• format router\n• TEXT-LAYER PROBE:\n   chars/page heuristic →\n   machine-readable vs\n   scanned\n• LAYOUT PARSER (Docling\n   / unstructured hi_res):\n   reading order, 2-column\n   detection, tables,\n   headers/footers,\n   footnotes, exhibit\n   stamps over body text\n• OCR (Tesseract /\n   PaddleOCR) on scanned\n   pages, per-page conf",
      "fontSize": 11.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
