      "text": "the BRD §15 risk, caught\nhere instead of at M4 —\na clause pulled from a\nmis-ordered two-column\npage looks correct, which\nis why it is worse than\nno extraction:\n• reading-order score\n• column sanity check\n• table integrity check\n• OCR conf < threshold\n   → page flagged, shown\n   in the UI\n• hard fail → quarantine,\n   never indexed",
      "originalText": "the BRD §15 risk, caught\nhere instead of at M4 —\na clause pulled from a\nmis-ordered two-column\npage looks correct, which\nis why it is worse than\nno extraction:\n• reading-order score\n• column sanity check\n• table integrity check\n• OCR conf < threshold\n   → page flagged, shown\n   in the UI\n• hard fail → quarantine,\n   never indexed",
