      "text": "• doc type classifier:\n   contract | opinion |\n   pleading | other\n• section / clause tree\n   (numbered clauses for\n   contracts, opinion parts)\n• SECTION-AWARE CHUNKER\n   child  ~512 tok, 64 overlap\n   parent = whole section\n   a numbered clause is\n   never split\n• span offsets preserved",
      "originalText": "• doc type classifier:\n   contract | opinion |\n   pleading | other\n• section / clause tree\n   (numbered clauses for\n   contracts, opinion parts)\n• SECTION-AWARE CHUNKER\n   child  ~512 tok, 64 overlap\n   parent = whole section\n   a numbered clause is\n   never split\n• span offsets preserved",
