      "text": "• dense embeddings\n   (batched) + sparse\n   BM25 / SPLADE vectors\n• upsert points → Qdrant\n   with full payload\n• chunk_meta rows →\n   SQLite\n• index_version stamped\n• status = ready  →\n   document becomes\n   retrievable (FR-7)",
