      "text": "labelled set from public-domain documents\nonly — never client files (DR-5)\n\nretrieval recall@k   (no LLM in the loop)\ncitation precision   100% or the build fails\ngroundedness         >= 95%\ncorrect / false refusal\ndraft acceptance\n\nruns in CI on every change (NFR-15)",
